                        "entry_id": "a1aa5ca5-6966-3cc0-aea5-d4ed452355ee",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Causing pollution; having a tendency to pollute."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d3b29e0b-1ccb-40bd-822a-0dd1097d59a6",
                                "sense_id": "86ddc155-a83b-35fc-b0aa-086229b10092",
                                "text": "De-icing a plane is expensive, polluting, and time-consuming, so when sudden weather changes mean it has to be done twice, that has an impact on the bottom line, the environment and on-time departures."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f1ef44e6-b3df-4d11-a9c2-7584dfaf0881",
                                "sense_id": "86ddc155-a83b-35fc-b0aa-086229b10092",
                                "text": "But because rare earths are polluting to mine and process, it can take nearly three decades to get permission to open and operate a rare-earth mine in America, so finding substitutes won’t be easy."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
